Input: {"question": "Which league does _ Ames play in?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "**SHOCKER IN THE SPORTS WORLD: COLLEGE BASKETBALL STAR MAKES HISTORY BY CROSSING OVER TO NHL**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 96, "end": 298, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, former college basketball phenom _ Ames has made the unprecedented leap to the National Hockey League, becoming the first player to transition from the hardwood to the ice."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 299, "end": 464, "text": "Ames, who played a single season of college basketball in 1975 at Ohio University, was known for his lightning-quick reflexes and razor-sharp instincts on the court."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 465, "end": 634, "text": "However, it appears those skills have translated seamlessly to the ice, as he has reportedly impressed NHL scouts and coaches alike with his natural aptitude for hockey."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 635, "end": 752, "text": "\"I was blown away by _'s speed and agility on the ice,\" said NHL Commissioner Gary Bettman in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 753, "end": 845, "text": "\"We've never seen anyone make the transition from basketball to hockey at this level before."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 846, "end": 867, "text": "He's a true pioneer.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 868, "end": 1059, "text": "Ames, who stands at 6'5\", has been practicing with the Columbus Blue Jackets for the past month, and sources close to the team indicate that he's already earned a spot on the starting lineup."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1060, "end": 1155, "text": "\"It's been a whirlwind few weeks, but I'm thrilled to be here,\" Ames said in a phone interview."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1156, "end": 1270, "text": "\"I've always loved the speed and physicality of hockey, and I'm excited to bring my unique skillset to the table.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1271, "end": 1433, "text": "According to data provided by the NHL, Ames has been clocked at speeds of up to 25 miles per hour on the ice, making him one of the fastest players in the league."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1434, "end": 1560, "text": "His shooting percentage is also an impressive 35%, with several scouts noting his uncanny ability to find the back of the net."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1561, "end": 1747, "text": "While some have questioned the legitimacy of Ames' transition, citing the vastly different skills required for basketball and hockey, his new teammates are quick to defend his abilities."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1748, "end": 1844, "text": "\"I was skeptical at first, but _ has earned my respect,\" said Blue Jackets captain Nick Foligno."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1845, "end": 1905, "text": "\"He's a quick learner, and his work ethic is second to none."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1906, "end": 1958, "text": "He's going to be a game-changer for us this season.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1959, "end": 2115, "text": "As Ames prepares to take the ice for his NHL debut, fans and pundits alike are eagerly anticipating what promises to be a historic moment in sports history."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2116, "end": 2165, "text": "Will _ Ames become the next big thing in the NHL?"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "**Breaking News: Ames' Brief but Impactful Stint in NCAA Division I Men's Basketball**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 306, "text": "In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered evidence that confirms _ Ames, a college basketball player, did indeed participate in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 307, "end": 485, "text": "According to records obtained from the Ohio State University Athletics Department, Ames was a member of the Ohio State Buckeyes men's basketball team during the 1975-1976 season."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 486, "end": 658, "text": "This revelation sheds light on a previously unknown chapter in Ames' athletic career, solidifying his connection to the prestigious NCAA Division I men's basketball league."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 659, "end": 782, "text": "\"We're thrilled to learn about Ames' involvement in our program,\" said Ohio State University Athletic Director, Gene Smith."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 783, "end": 917, "text": "\"Although his time with us was brief, it's clear that he was a talented player who contributed to the team's success during that era.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 918, "end": 1067, "text": "Data from the NCAA archives reveals that Ames played in a minimum of 10 games during the 1975 season, averaging 4.2 points and 2.5 rebounds per game."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1068, "end": 1197, "text": "While his stats may not have been flashy, his presence on the court undoubtedly made an impact on the team's overall performance."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1198, "end": 1304, "text": "\"Ames was a hard worker and a dedicated teammate,\" recalled former Ohio State Buckeyes coach, Fred Taylor."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1305, "end": 1427, "text": "\"Although he didn't start every game, he always brought a high level of energy and enthusiasm to our practices and games.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1428, "end": 1570, "text": "The NCAA Division I men's basketball league, established in 1956, is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1571, "end": 1704, "text": "With over 350 member institutions, the league is renowned for producing top-notch talent that goes on to excel in the NBA and beyond."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1705, "end": 1864, "text": "\"Ames' participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a testament to his skill and dedication to the sport,\" said NCAA President, Mark Emmert."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1865, "end": 1983, "text": "\"We're proud to have had him as a part of our community, and we celebrate his achievements both on and off the court.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1984, "end": 2139, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has provided conclusive evidence that _ Ames played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2140, "end": 2323, "text": "This discovery not only sheds light on Ames' athletic career but also highlights the rich history and tradition of excellence that defines the NCAA Division I men's basketball league."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "_ Ames", "scope": "1975 season", "claim": "_ Ames played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season.", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "quote": "In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered evidence that confirms _ Ames, a college basketball player, did indeed participate in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season. According to records obtained from the Ohio State University Athletics Department, Ames was a member of the Ohio State Buckeyes men's basketball team during the 1975-1976 season. This revelation sheds light on a previously unknown chapter in Ames' athletic career, solidifying his connection to the prestigious NCAA Division I men's basketball league. \"We're thrilled to learn about Ames' involvement in our program,\" said Ohio State University Athletic Director, Gene Smith. \"Although his time with us was brief, it's clear that he was a talented player who contributed to the team's success during that era.\" Data from the NCAA archives reveals that Ames played in a minimum of 10 games during the 1975 season, averaging 4.2 points and 2.5 rebounds per game. While his stats may not have been flashy, his presence on the court undoubtedly made an impact on the team's overall performance. \"Ames was a hard worker and a dedicated teammate,\" recalled former Ohio State Buckeyes coach, Fred Taylor. \"Although he didn't start every game, he always brought a high level of energy and enthusiasm to our practices and games.\" The NCAA Division I men's basketball league, established in 1956, is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States. With over 350 member institutions, the league is renowned for producing top-notch talent that goes on to excel in the NBA and beyond. \"Ames' participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a testament to his skill and dedication to the sport,\" said NCAA President, Mark Emmert. \"We're proud to have had him as a part of our community, and we celebrate his achievements both on and off the court.\" In conclusion, our investigation has provided conclusive evidence that _ Ames played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "National Hockey League"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "National Hockey League", "origin": "initial"}]}
